# 18. Reference implementation
Create a **Nova ISA reference emulator/interpreter**.

The emulator should model the architectural state, not a hypothetical CPU microarchitecture.

It must implement:

- registers;
- PC;
- instruction fetch;
- instruction decode;
- instruction execution;
- memory;
- exceptions;
- privilege state;
- interrupts;
- object/reference operations;
